    "turn_idx": 13,
    "turn_text": "you can listen to your favorite news podcasts, ad-free? Good news. With Amazon Music, you have access to the largest catalog of ad-free top podcasts included with your prime membership. To start listening, download the Amazon Music app or visit amazon.com slash news ad-free. That's amazon.com slash news ad-free and catch up on the latest episodes without the ads. Welcome back to the Rick Smith Show. Now, here is Rick Smith. So you know, it's no surprise to anyone right now. We're in this really kind of bizarre place. Our political divide is in a really, really, really severe condition. Large swaths of the population are in their camps and never shall they ever speak or engage or have just discussions that just a couple of years ago were possible. And for instance, I've had several conversations recently, and I've talked about this, where things go wonderfully. Things go great. There's common ground, there's agreement, there's even laughter and understanding. In the second you get anywhere near something that might possibly be political, it's knives out. There are things we used to agree on, believe it or not. Like infrastructure, some of those things we used to believe. There were no Democratic roads or Republican roads or no Democratic bridges, Republican bridges. There were just roads and bridges. But now we can't get anything done because we might give the other side a win. And the sad reality is when our politicians start looking at things that way, We all lose. And look, it doesn't matter to me who you voted for in the last",
